WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.792
- Like, we have to start 
getting into meritocracy.

00:00:03.792 --> 00:00:05.839
Somebody should lose if they're

00:00:05.839 --> 00:00:07.975
not seeing where 
the puck is going.

00:00:07.975 --> 00:00:11.745
If you're driving a truck
today, you know it's coming.

00:00:11.745 --> 00:00:12.412
You've heard it.

00:00:12.412 --> 00:00:16.550
Somebody told you at a 
bus stop, at a truck stop,

00:00:16.550 --> 00:00:19.086
over dinner, somebody 
brought up this theory.

00:00:19.086 --> 00:00:20.821
So either you take it seriously

00:00:20.821 --> 00:00:24.273
and start educating 
yourself or you don't.

00:00:24.273 --> 00:00:25.959
That's the game.

00:00:25.959 --> 00:00:27.694
Nobody's gonna fix that.

00:00:27.694 --> 00:00:29.429
Nobody can help you with that.

00:00:29.429 --> 00:00:31.665
That's life and 
that's the historic nature

00:00:31.665 --> 00:00:34.001
of human beings forever.

00:00:34.001 --> 00:00:36.870
So just 'cause we're now living
and it's our turn to go through

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:40.797
something, this 
has always happened.

00:00:40.797 --> 00:00:41.655
- [Daymond] You're right.

00:00:41.655 --> 00:00:43.543
It's just 
happening faster, I think.

00:00:43.543 --> 00:00:44.945
- Great. Adjust.

00:00:44.945 --> 00:00:47.947
(light music)

